    "fact_rationales": {
      "F10": "Superficial and deep perivascular and interstitial inflammation is a non-specific finding that can be seen in various dermatological conditions.",
      "F11": "Numerous eosinophils are a characteristic feature of eosinophilic annular erythema and drug reaction with eosinophilia and systemic symptoms.",
      "F12": "Negative PAS stain rules out fungal infections, such as tinea corporis.",
